==================================================================
8. ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES (set in Vercel production)
==================================================================
- NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL       https://tatvapractice.com (canonical)
- RESEND_API_KEY             Resend API key (enables real email send)
- RESEND_FROM                e.g. "TatvaPractice <noreply@tatvacare.in>"
- CONTACT_NOTIFY_EMAIL       inbox (default support@tatvacare.in)
- GOOGLE_SITE_VERIFICATION   Search Console verification token

==================================================================
9. GIT WORKFLOW
==================================================================
- Branch: main. Remote: origin (github shyamgrdesign2-dot/TP_Website).
- Commit messages: short imperative subject, then a bulleted body that
  explains the WHY. Co-author trailer is fine.
- Never force-push main. Never skip hooks. Create new commits, not amends.
- Only commit when asked. Push to main only when explicitly asked.

==================================================================
